~~ Generations are an undo history: nothing is overwritten, so an older draft is
~~ still readable, and planting it back is a redo.

"" => sow doc.
doc + "hello" => doc.
doc + " world" => doc.
doc + "!" => doc.

utter doc.
utter doc@1.
utter doc@2.
utter depth doc.

doc@2 => doc.
utter doc.
utter depth doc.
utter doc@1.
